[["trip","noun","/trɪp/","旅行","a journey to a place and back again","die Reise; der Ausflug","We went on a trip to the coast.","我们去海边旅行了一趟。"],["ticket","noun","/ˈtɪkɪt/","票","a piece of paper that shows you have paid to travel or enter","die Fahrkarte; die Eintrittskarte","I bought a return ticket.","我买了往返票。"],["luggage","noun","/ˈlʌɡɪdʒ/","行李","the bags you take when you travel","das Gepäck","My luggage is too heavy.","我的行李太重了。"],["airport","noun","/ˈeəpɔːt/","机场","a place where planes land and take off","der Flughafen","We need to be at the airport by six.","我们六点前要到机场。"],["flight","noun","/flaɪt/","航班","a journey in a plane","der Flug","The flight was delayed by two hours.","航班延误了两个小时。"],["passport","noun","/ˈpɑːspɔːt/","护照","an official document you need to travel abroad","der Reisepass","Don't forget your passport.","别忘了护照。"],["map","noun","/mæp/","地图","a drawing of an area showing roads, towns, etc.","die Karte; der Stadtplan","Let's check the map.","我们看看地图。"],["corner","noun","/ˈkɔːnə/","拐角","the place where two streets meet","die Ecke","The café is on the corner.","咖啡馆在拐角处。"],["menu","noun","/ˈmenjuː/","菜单","a list of the food in a restaurant","die Speisekarte","Could we see the menu, please?","可以看一下菜单吗？"],["bill","noun","/bɪl/","账单","a piece of paper showing how much you must pay","die Rechnung","Can we have the bill, please?","请给我们账单。"],["dish","noun","/dɪʃ/","菜肴；盘子","food prepared in a particular way; a plate","das Gericht; die Schüssel","This is my favourite dish.","这是我最喜欢的菜。"],["fridge","noun","/frɪdʒ/","冰箱","a machine that keeps food cold","der Kühlschrank","Put the milk in the fridge.","把牛奶放进冰箱。"],["neighbour","noun","/ˈneɪbə/","邻居","a person who lives near you","der Nachbar; die Nachbarin","Our neighbours are very friendly.","我们的邻居很友好。"],["health","noun","/helθ/","健康","the condition of your body and mind","die Gesundheit","Walking is good for your health.","走路对健康有益。"],["headache","noun","/ˈhedeɪk/","头痛","a pain in your head","die Kopfschmerzen","I've got a terrible headache.","我头疼得厉害。"],["medicine","noun","/ˈmedsn/","药","something you take when you are ill","das Medikament","Take this medicine twice a day.","这药一天吃两次。"],["chemist's","noun","/ˈkemɪsts/","药店","a shop that sells medicine","die Apotheke","Is there a chemist's near here?","附近有药店吗？"],["gift","noun","/ɡɪft/","礼物","something you give to someone","das Geschenk","Thank you for the lovely gift.","谢谢你的好礼物。"],["clothes","noun","/kləʊðz/","衣服","things you wear","die Kleidung","I need some new clothes.","我需要几件新衣服。"],["size","noun","/saɪz/","尺寸","how big something is","die Größe","Do you have this in a smaller size?","这个有小一号的吗？"],["price","noun","/praɪs/","价格","the amount of money something costs","der Preis","The price includes breakfast.","价格含早餐。"],["message","noun","/ˈmesɪdʒ/","消息","a piece of written or spoken information","die Nachricht","I'll send you a message later.","我晚点给你发消息。"],["hobby","noun","/ˈhɒbi/","爱好","something you do for fun in your free time","das Hobby","My hobby is gardening.","我的爱好是园艺。"],["arrive","v","/əˈraɪv/","到达","to get to a place","ankommen","What time does the train arrive?","火车几点到？"],["leave","v","/liːv/","离开","to go away from a place","verlassen; abfahren","I leave home at eight.","我八点出门。"],["wait","v","/weɪt/","等","to stay until something happens","warten","Wait for me here.","在这儿等我。"],["pay","v","/peɪ/","付钱","to give money for something","bezahlen","Can I pay by card?","可以刷卡吗？"],["find","v","/faɪnd/","找到","to discover where something is","finden","I can't find my keys.","我找不到钥匙了。"],["forget","v","/fəˈɡet/","忘记","to not remember","vergessen","I forgot her birthday.","我忘了她的生日。"],["remember","v","/rɪˈmembə/","记得","to keep something in your mind","sich erinnern","Do you remember his name?","你记得他的名字吗？"],["invite","v","/ɪnˈvaɪt/","邀请","to ask someone to come to an event","einladen","They invited us to dinner.","他们请我们吃晚饭。"],["call","v","/kɔːl/","打电话；叫","to phone someone","anrufen","I'll call you tonight.","我今晚给你打电话。"],["start","v","/stɑːt/","开始","to begin doing something","anfangen; beginnen","The film starts at eight.","电影八点开始。"],["finish","v","/ˈfɪnɪʃ/","完成；结束","to end something","beenden; fertig werden","I finish work at five.","我五点下班。"],["carry","v","/ˈkæri/","携带；搬","to hold something while moving","tragen","Can you carry this bag?","你能拿一下这个包吗？"],["change","v","/tʃeɪndʒ/","改变；换","to become or make different","ändern; wechseln","I need to change trains in Leeds.","我得在利兹换车。"],["busy","adj","/ˈbɪzi/","忙的","having a lot to do","beschäftigt","I'm too busy this week.","我这周太忙了。"],["ill","adj","/ɪl/","生病的","not well","krank","She's been ill all week.","她病了一整周。"],["sad","adj","/sæd/","难过的","not happy","traurig","The film was very sad.","这部电影很悲伤。"],["difficult","adj","/ˈdɪfɪkəlt/","难的","not easy","schwierig","German grammar is difficult.","德语语法很难。"],["quiet","adj","/ˈkwaɪət/","安静的","making little noise","ruhig; leise","It's a quiet street.","这是一条安静的街。"],["noisy","adj","/ˈnɔɪzi/","吵的","making a lot of noise","laut","The bar was really noisy.","酒吧非常吵。"],["near","adj","/nɪə/","近的","not far","nah","The station is quite near.","车站很近。"],["far","adv","/fɑː/","远","a long way","weit","Is it far from here?","离这里远吗？"],["sometimes","adv","/ˈsʌmtaɪmz/","有时","on some occasions","manchmal","I sometimes work from home.","我有时在家办公。"],["already","adv","/ɔːlˈredi/","已经","before now","schon","I've already eaten.","我已经吃过了。"],["meeting","noun","/ˈmiːtɪŋ/","会议","an occasion when people come together to discuss things","die Besprechung; das Treffen","The meeting starts at ten.","会议十点开始。"],["job","noun","/dʒɒb/","工作","the work you do to earn money","der Job; die Stelle","She has a new job in marketing.","她在市场部找了份新工作。"],["boss","noun","/bɒs/","老板","the person in charge of you at work","der Chef; die Chefin","My boss is very fair.","我的老板很公正。"],["office","noun","/ˈɒfɪs/","办公室","a room or building where people work at desks","das Büro","The office is on the third floor.","办公室在三楼。"],["email","noun","/ˈiːmeɪl/","电子邮件","a message sent by computer","die E-Mail","I'll send you an email with the details.","我把细节用邮件发给你。"],["mistake","noun","/mɪˈsteɪk/","错误","something that is wrong","der Fehler","Sorry, that was my mistake.","对不起，那是我的错。"],["problem","noun","/ˈprɒbləm/","问题","something that causes difficulty","das Problem","No problem!","没问题！"],["idea","noun","/aɪˈdɪə/","主意","a thought or plan","die Idee","That's a great idea.","好主意。"],["party","noun","/ˈpɑːti/","聚会","a social event with food, drinks and music","die Party; das Fest","Are you coming to the party?","你来参加聚会吗？"],["sport","noun","/spɔːt/","运动","a game or activity done for exercise or fun","der Sport","Football is my favourite sport.","足球是我最喜欢的运动。"],["team","noun","/tiːm/","队；团队","a group of people who play or work together","die Mannschaft; das Team","Our team won the match.","我们队赢了比赛。"],["museum","noun","/mjuˈziːəm/","博物馆","a building where old or interesting things are shown","das Museum","The museum is free on Sundays.","博物馆周日免费。"],["beach","noun","/biːtʃ/","海滩","an area of sand or stones by the sea","der Strand","We spent the day at the beach.","我们在海滩待了一天。"],["mountain","noun","/ˈmaʊntən/","山","a very high hill","der Berg","They climbed the mountain in four hours.","他们四小时爬上了山。"],["rain","noun","/reɪn/","雨","water that falls from the sky","der Regen","Take an umbrella, there's rain coming.","带把伞，要下雨了。"],["snow","noun","/snəʊ/","雪","soft white frozen water that falls from the sky","der Schnee","The children played in the snow.","孩子们在雪地里玩。"],["wind","noun","/wɪnd/","风","air that moves","der Wind","The wind is very strong today.","今天风很大。"],["bridge","noun","/brɪdʒ/","桥","a structure that crosses a river or road","die Brücke","Walk across the bridge and turn left.","过桥后左转。"],["key","noun","/kiː/","钥匙","a piece of metal used to open a lock","der Schlüssel","I've lost my house key.","我把家门钥匙丢了。"],["bring","v","/brɪŋ/","带来","to take something with you to a place","mitbringen","Bring a jacket, it's cold.","带件外套，天冷。"],["send","v","/send/","寄；发送","to make something go to another place","schicken; senden","I sent the parcel yesterday.","我昨天寄了包裹。"],["try","v","/traɪ/","尝试","to make an effort to do something","versuchen","Try this cake, it's delicious.","尝尝这个蛋糕，很好吃。"],["visit","v","/ˈvɪzɪt/","拜访；参观","to go and see a person or place","besuchen","We visited my grandparents.","我们去看望了祖父母。"],["travel","v","/ˈtrævl/","旅行","to go from one place to another, often far","reisen","I love travelling by train.","我喜欢坐火车旅行。"],["sell","v","/sel/","卖","to give something in exchange for money","verkaufen","They sell fresh fish at the market.","他们在市场卖鲜鱼。"],["lose","v","/luːz/","丢失；输","to be unable to find; not to win","verlieren","Don't lose your ticket.","别把票弄丢了。"],["win","v","/wɪn/","赢","to be the best in a game or competition","gewinnen","Who won the game?","谁赢了比赛？"],["feel","v","/fiːl/","感觉","to experience an emotion or physical state","sich fühlen","I feel much better today.","我今天感觉好多了。"],["understand","v","/ˌʌndəˈstænd/","理解","to know what something means","verstehen","I don't understand this word.","我不懂这个词。"],["dangerous","adj","/ˈdeɪndʒərəs/","危险的","likely to cause harm","gefährlich","It's dangerous to swim here.","在这里游泳很危险。"],["important","adj","/ɪmˈpɔːtnt/","重要的","having great value or effect","wichtig","This meeting is very important.","这次会议非常重要。"],["interesting","adj","/ˈɪntrəstɪŋ/","有趣的","making you want to know more","interessant","That's an interesting question.","这是个有意思的问题。"],["boring","adj","/ˈbɔːrɪŋ/","无聊的","not interesting","langweilig","The lecture was boring.","讲座很无聊。"],["delicious","adj","/dɪˈlɪʃəs/","美味的","tasting very good","lecker","This soup is delicious.","这汤真好喝。"],["early","adj","/ˈɜːli/","早的","before the usual time","früh","I had an early breakfast.","我早早吃了早餐。"],["late","adj","/leɪt/","晚的；迟的","after the usual or expected time","spät","Sorry I'm late.","对不起我迟到了。"],["free","adj","/friː/","免费的；空闲的","costing nothing; not busy","kostenlos; frei","Are you free on Saturday?","你周六有空吗？"],["full","adj","/fʊl/","满的；饱的","containing as much as possible","voll; satt","I'm full, thank you.","我吃饱了，谢谢。"],["empty","adj","/ˈempti/","空的","with nothing inside","leer","The fridge is empty.","冰箱是空的。"],["ready","adj","/ˈredi/","准备好的","prepared","fertig; bereit","Dinner is ready!","晚饭好了！"],["still","adv","/stɪl/","仍然","continuing until now","noch","Are you still at work?","你还在上班吗？"],["soon","adv","/suːn/","很快","in a short time","bald","See you soon!","回头见！"],["together","adv","/təˈɡeðə/","一起","with each other","zusammen","Let's have lunch together.","我们一起吃午饭吧。"],["maybe","adv","/ˈmeɪbi/","也许","perhaps","vielleicht","Maybe we can meet tomorrow.","也许我们明天可以见面。"],["enough","adv","/ɪˈnʌf/","足够","as much as is needed","genug","Do we have enough time?","我们时间够吗？"],["but","conj","/bʌt/","但是","used to introduce something different","aber","It's small but cosy.","它不大但很温馨。"],["so","conj","/səʊ/","所以","for this reason","also; deshalb","It was raining, so we stayed in.","下雨了，所以我们待在家里。"],["if","conj","/ɪf/","如果","used to talk about a possible situation","wenn; falls","If you're tired, go to bed.","如果你累了就去睡吧。"]]